        rdfs:comment        "In response to TGF-beta signaling, RUNX3, in cooperation with activated SMADs and FOXO3A, induces transcription of the pro-apoptotic gene BCL2L11 (BIM) (Wildey et al. 2003, Yano et al. 2006, Yamamura et al. 2006)." ;
